Template: remotedesktop-host/server-address
Type: string
Default: @DEFAULT_RENDEZVOUS_URI@
Description: Signaling server address:
 The WebSocket address of the server this machine registers with, for
 example ws://rd.example.com:5080/ws (no TLS) or
 wss://rd.example.com:5080/ws (TLS).
 .
 127.0.0.1 only reaches a server on this machine. Both machines in a
 session must be pointed at the same server.

Template: remotedesktop-host/server-certificate
Type: string
Default:
Description: Server certificate:
 Only used for a wss:// address. The PEM certificate of a server that
 uses a self-signed certificate; it is installed into this machine's
 trust store.
 .
 Leave empty if the server's certificate comes from a public authority,
 or if the address is ws://.
